// RESTORE: packages/darklang/cli/registry.dark
// WAS: the `outliner` command (alias `tree-exp`): its row in Registry.allCommands, its
//      argument grammar, its place in the Utilities help group, and its entry in
//      `screenCommands`, the list of commands the workbench's `:` bar launches as a page
//      rather than capturing.
// ANCHOR: acceptsOutliner sat between acceptsDelete and acceptsExportSeed. The row sat
//      between ("delete", ...) and ("export-seed", ...). In commandGroups, "outliner" sat
//      between "workbench" and "backups" in the Utilities group. `screenCommands` was
//      `[ "outliner" ]` and is `[]` now.
// ALSO: later/packages/darklang/cli/outliner/ (the app itself: app, commands, core, editor,
//       main, store, next-steps.md, plus the export-import fragments already there).
// ALSO: later/packages/darklang/tests/cli/outliner.dark (its tests). Its TextField, Picker
